{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33896","headline":"鲁望示广文先生吴门二章情格高散可醒俗态因追想山中风度次韵属和存於诗编鲁望之命也 二 · 皮日休","name":"鲁望示广文先生吴门二章情格高散可醒俗态因追想山中风度次韵属和存於诗编鲁望之命也 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"能谙肉芝样，解讲隐书文。\n终古神仙窟，穷年麋鹿羣。\n行厨煮白石，卧具拂青云。\n应在雷平上，支颐复半醺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33896.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33896","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}